<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<pnml xmlns="http://www.pnml.org/version-2009/grammar/pnml">
  <net id="SEQ-07i" type="http://www.pnml.org/version-2009/grammar/ptnet">
    <name><text>07i A works contract with an advance, progress billings and retention money (example of the Manual)</text></name>
    <page id="page1">
      <place id="p1"><name><text>start</text></name><initialMarking><text>1</text></initialMarking></place>
      <place id="p2"><name><text>p2</text></name></place>
      <place id="p3"><name><text>p3</text></name></place>
      <place id="p4"><name><text>p4</text></name></place>
      <place id="p5"><name><text>p5</text></name></place>
      <place id="p6"><name><text>p6</text></name></place>
      <place id="p7"><name><text>p7</text></name></place>
      <place id="p8"><name><text>p8</text></name></place>
      <place id="p9"><name><text>p9</text></name></place>
      <place id="p10"><name><text>p10</text></name></place>
      <place id="p11"><name><text>p11</text></name></place>
      <place id="p12"><name><text>p12</text></name></place>
      <place id="p13"><name><text>p13</text></name></place>
      <place id="p14"><name><text>p14</text></name></place>
      <place id="p15"><name><text>p15</text></name></place>
      <place id="p16"><name><text>end</text></name></place>
      <transition id="t01"><name><text>1. Suppliers and payees to Cash unit: Performance security before the contract is signed. In the example: cash of 75,000. Books: Guaranty/Security Deposits Payable 75,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t02"><name><text>2. Budget unit: Obligation for the whole contract price: 800,000 in the registry. No journal entry</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t03"><name><text>3. Suppliers and payees to Project unit: Written request for an advance, with a letter of credit, a bank guarantee or a surety bond</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t04"><name><text>4. Accounting unit to Suppliers and payees: Advance of 15 percent: 120,000. Books: debit Advances to Contractors 120,000, credit Cash-MDS, Regular 120,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t05"><name><text>5. Suppliers and payees to Project unit: Statement of work accomplished: 400,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t06"><name><text>6. Project unit to Accounting unit: The engineer checks the statement and certifies the amount to be paid</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t07"><name><text>7. Accounting unit: Books: debit Construction in Progress 400,000. Credit Advances to Contractors 60,000 (half of the advance is recovered) and Accounts Payable 340,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t08"><name><text>8. Accounting unit to Suppliers and payees: Payment of 282,200. Books: debit Accounts Payable 340,000. Credit Cash-MDS, Regular 282,200, Guaranty/Security Deposits Payable 34,000 (retention), Due to BIR 23,800 (tax withheld)</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t09"><name><text>9. Suppliers and payees to Project unit: Statement of work accomplished: 400,000. Certificate of completion</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t10"><name><text>10. Accounting unit: Books: debit Construction in Progress 400,000. Credit Advances to Contractors 60,000 and Accounts Payable 340,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t11"><name><text>11. Suppliers and payees to Cash unit: Damages for the delay: 8,000, collected in cash. Books: Miscellaneous Income 8,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t12"><name><text>12. Accounting unit to Suppliers and payees: Payment of 282,200. Retention 34,000. Tax withheld 23,800</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t13"><name><text>13. Accounting unit: Turn-over of the building. Books: debit Buildings 800,000, credit Construction in Progress 800,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t14"><name><text>14. Accounting unit to Suppliers and payees: Release of the retention money: 68,000. Books: debit Guaranty/Security Deposits Payable 68,000, credit Cash-MDS, Regular 68,000</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t15"><name><text>15. Cash unit to Suppliers and payees: Return of the performance security: 75,000</text></name></transition>
      <arc id="a1" source="p1" target="t01"/>
